2.1.evidence:
(1) The Regional Government establishes an Integrated Service Center (PPT) as the Implementing Institution for the Prevention and Protection of Women and Child Victims of Violence.
(2) The PPT as referred to in paragraph (1) consists of elements of:
a. health;
b. law enforcement;
c. social affairs and empowerment;
d. education and religious affairs;
e. Non-Governmental Organizations; and
f. private sector.
